    "code": null,
    "label": null,
    "params": {
     "text": "## iconmap all\n\nBoth tables read the same **Tags** column with the same map.\n\n- **Every matching icon** says `iconmap all:` — a row tagged\n  `fix, test, late` gets 🔧 🧪 🔥.\n- **First match only** is the default — the same row gets just 🔧.\n\n- **Touching (gap 0)** / **Spread (gap 12)** add `gap N`: the pixels\n  between the icons (ordinary is 4).\n\nOpen any table's **Rules…** builder: the map page has\n**show every matching icon** and **Gap between icons** under the value\ntable.\n\nThe **Report** page embeds the left table live and plain — switch its\npreview to **Web** to check icons against the cell edges.\n",
     "width": 520,
     "height": 340
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "data",
    "type": "flograph.io.table",
    "pos": [
     0,
     420
    ],
    "code": null,
    "label": "Tasks",
    "params": {
     "data": "{\"version\": 2, \"columns\": [{\"name\": \"Task\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"name\": \"Tags\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"name\": \"Owner\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"name\": \"Note\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"name\": \"Amount\", \"type\": \"number\"}], \"rows\": [[\"Build the importer\", \"fix, test, late\", \"Alice\", \"urgent: the nightly load failed twice this week\", 12345.5], [\"Ship 0.1.25\", \"fix\", \"Bob\", \"fine\", 99.0], [\"Write the handbook page\", \"docs, test\", \"Alice\", \"urgent\", 100000.25], [\"Tidy the repo\", \"chore\", \"Carol\", \"a long note with many words in it, to see how a cell wraps\", 5.0], [\"Profile the run\", \"perf, test, late\", \"Dana\", \"AVeryLongUnbrokenIdentifierThatCannotWrapAnywhere\", 2500.0]]}",
     "width": 520,
     "height": 260
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "all",
    "type": "flograph.viz.show_table",
    "pos": [
     640,
     0
    ],
    "code": null,
    "label": "Every matching icon",
    "params": {
     "format_rules": "# iconmap ALL — every key the value matches adds its icon\nTags    iconmap all: *fix*=🔧, *test*=🧪 green, *late*=🔥, *docs*=📘, *perf*=⚡ amber\n\n# icons elsewhere, for the web-report check\nOwner   = Alice => icon ✓ green\nOwner   = Bob   => icon ! amber right\nNote    contains urgent => pill red \"URGENT\"\nAmount  > 1000 => icon ▲ green\nAmount  < 100  => icon ▼ red right\n",
     "hide": "",
     "width": 900,
     "height": 300,
     "scale": 100
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "first",
    "type": "flograph.viz.show_table",
    "pos": [
     640,
     420
    ],
    "code": null,
    "label": "First match only",
    "params": {
     "format_rules": "# the default — the FIRST key that matches wins the cell\nTags    iconmap: *fix*=🔧, *test*=🧪 green, *late*=🔥, *docs*=📘, *perf*=⚡ amber\n",
     "hide": "",
     "width": 900,
     "height": 300,
     "scale": 100
    }
   },
